OL,4,CNato chief vows defence against space  
OL,5,Cthreat after Russian nuclear satellite 
OL,6,Creports                                
OL,7,GNato chief Mark Rutte has said the     
OL,8,Galliance will defend against any       
OL,9,Gthreats in space after German reports  
OL,10,Gthat Russia is preparing to launch a   
OL,11,Gnuclear-armed satellite.               
OL,13,FIntelligence reports about a possible  
OL,14,Flaunch in the next 60 days had been    
OL,15,Fshared among Nato countries this       
OL,16,Fmonth, according to German media. It   
OL,17,Fwas not clear which country had        
OL,18,Fauthored the reports.                  
